No solution that I am aware of. In the parameterization I use in brms, mu is the mean, but as you say, the precision depends on the mean.

The only solution would be to add a new family, gamma2() say, that uses your parameterization. You may comment on https://github.com/paul-buerkner/brms/issues/110 so that I don't lose track of it.

