Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

As far as I understand the paper, the multiple domain model can not yet achieved with brms, because there is no syntax to define coefficients of different response variables
to be the same. That is, they will *not* share coefficients, which I understand is needed for the multiple domain model(?)

