> Paper: https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/hbm.23052
>
> Code: https://zenodo.org/record/33432#.Wq403q2cbK  - although that code does not use a true multivariate distribution.
>
> Many thanks,
> James

